{"id":"wb-1-91","name":"华严寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"华严寺 (大同)","text":"华严寺位于中国山西省大同市清远门（西门）内的清远街南侧，下寺坡街459号，东临华严寺广场及华严街，因佛教华严宗而得名，寺内有辽代的薄伽教藏殿和金代的大雄宝殿以及诸多彩塑，具有极高的文物价值和艺术价值，1961年被列为第一批全国重点文物保护单位，是中国仅存的三大辽代寺院之一。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%8E%E4%B8%A5%E5%AF%BA_(%E5%A4%A7%E5%90%8C)","revisionId":94580123,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94580123","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/931d1fdf014b493360b85845.jpg","title":"Datong_Huayan_Si_2013.08.29_08-54-08.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Datong_Huayan_Si_2013.08.29_08-54-08.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3b/Datong_Huayan_Si_2013.08.29_08-54-08.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"大同华严寺——\n\n大雄宝殿","width":320,"height":213}}